WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 45= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:41.760 --> 01:42.510
Your Lordship!

8
01:43.310 --> 01:44.200
Your Lordship!

9
01:48.710 --> 01:49.640
Your Lordship!

10
01:50.230 --> 01:50.920
Your Lordship!

11
01:55.416 --> 01:57.400
While Marquis Yuan was inspecting the coast,

12
01:57.704 --> 01:59.560
his soldiers accidentally drank poisoned water

13
02:00.000 --> 02:01.640
and were then ambushed by pirates.

14
02:03.920 --> 02:04.920
Marquis Yuan

15
02:07.510 --> 02:08.910
was killed.

16
02:14.280 --> 02:15.310
Chengze...

17
02:17.520 --> 02:18.520
is dead?

18
02:22.840 --> 02:23.910
Is the news confirmed?

19
02:29.870 --> 02:30.750
Your Lordship sent me

20
02:30.750 --> 02:32.120
to warn Marquis Yuan.

21
02:32.248 --> 02:34.712
But by the time I reached the Zhejiang coast, it was too late.

22
02:35.272 --> 02:37.190
I only found Ding Peng, who was badly wounded.

23
02:40.248 --> 02:42.808
He told me to get this to Your Lordship as soon as possible.

24
02:43.800 --> 02:45.000
I returned to Jinling too late,

25
02:45.100 --> 02:47.896
so I had no choice but to sneak into the residence despite the curfew.

26
02:58.800 --> 03:00.150
Du Cuique.

27
03:05.800 --> 03:06.910
It's all my fault.

28
03:10.470 --> 03:13.120
Why didn't I kill her when I had the chance?

29
03:17.960 --> 03:18.870
Ding Peng also said

30
03:19.150 --> 03:20.960
Du Cuique's next target is the Lin Residence.

31
03:21.630 --> 03:22.590
Your Lordship,

32
03:22.824 --> 03:24.856
please make preparations as soon as possible.

33
03:30.910 --> 03:32.750
I'll go to Duke Xiangguo right now

34
03:32.808 --> 03:34.760
and ask him to send someone else to the capital.

35
03:34.800 --> 03:36.120
I'll stay and wait for Du Cuique.

36
03:36.120 --> 03:36.744
Your Lordship!

37
03:36.960 --> 03:37.560
When she comes,

38
03:37.560 --> 03:39.190
I'll make her pay for Chengze's death!

39
03:39.800 --> 03:40.560
Your Lordship!

40
03:41.680 --> 03:42.360
Your Lordship!

41
03:48.710 --> 03:50.710
Chengze once saved my life...

42
03:53.240 --> 03:54.240
I know.

43
03:54.680 --> 03:57.120
Chengze once saved my life!

44
04:00.100 --> 04:06.660
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

45
04:08.680 --> 04:11.360
If not for Commander Yuan waking me up with a few words, there would

46
04:11.400 --> 04:13.830
never have been an Assistant Commander Lin who traded his brush for a sword.

47
04:13.840 --> 04:15.360
In private, just call me Yuan.

48
04:15.400 --> 04:16.990
I am an official of the imperial court.

49
04:17.048 --> 04:18.600
I have not failed His Majesty's trust,

50
04:18.920 --> 04:20.510
nor have I failed the people.

51
04:21.720 --> 04:24.270
Please help the Crown Prince leave Jinling, Fengtai.

52
04:24.510 --> 04:25.720
Thank you for your help today.

53
04:26.160 --> 04:26.950
We're family.

54
04:27.000 --> 04:27.720
It's only right.

55
04:28.000 --> 04:28.630
Brother-in-law,

56
04:28.920 --> 04:30.720
you'll have to endure some hardship tonight.

57
04:31.368 --> 04:33.560
To rise above others and bring honor to one's family,

58
04:33.560 --> 04:34.600
what's wrong with that?

59
04:34.720 --> 04:36.888
Shouldn't a man seek high office and generous rewards,

60
04:36.936 --> 04:38.560
and win honors for his wife and children?

61
04:39.630 --> 04:41.160
The eunuchs wield great power now.

62
04:43.510 --> 04:44.310
You must be careful.

63
04:46.010 --> 04:50.040
♪With what I know and what I do♪

64
04:50.250 --> 04:53.210
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

65
04:53.340 --> 04:55.650
♪The long night is almost over♪

66
04:55.920 --> 05:04.040
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

67
05:05.080 --> 05:09.170
♪With my own hands and heart♪

68
05:09.170 --> 05:12.690
♪I write my name♪

69
05:13.080 --> 05:16.400
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

70
05:16.590 --> 05:19.890
♪Step by step toward the light♪

71
05:20.000 --> 05:24.040
♪With what I know and what I do♪

72
05:24.260 --> 05:27.430
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

73
05:27.430 --> 05:29.780
♪The long night is almost over♪

74
05:32.000 --> 05:32.830
Come take a look!

75
05:33.000 --> 05:33.920
Come and see!

76
05:34.600 --> 05:36.040
Everyone,

77
05:36.270 --> 05:37.070
take a good look!

78
05:37.070 --> 05:38.160
See for yourselves!

79
05:38.160 --> 05:39.270
(Notice)

80
05:39.270 --> 05:41.720
Anyone who reports a lead to the authorities

81
05:42.070 --> 05:44.160
will be rewarded twenty taels of silver.

82
05:44.870 --> 05:47.310
Anyone who helps the authorities capture the fugitive

83
05:47.950 --> 05:50.510
will be rewarded fifty taels of silver.

84
05:50.750 --> 05:52.830
The fugitive Du Cuique, a native of Jinzhou,

85
05:53.190 --> 05:55.750
(Wanted) born into a military household,

86
05:55.800 --> 05:57.310
fled to escape her sentence of exile.

87
05:57.390 --> 06:00.360
She willingly sank into depravity and became involved with a pirate leader.

88
06:00.800 --> 06:02.390
She then conspired with his men

89
06:02.472 --> 06:04.008
to poison and kill the pirate chief.

90
06:05.240 --> 06:09.720
Strike a man in the face and attack his sorest point.

91
06:11.480 --> 06:13.430
Such underhanded tactics

92
06:14.070 --> 06:15.480
would never occur to someone

93
06:15.480 --> 06:16.990
of Lin Jinqi's privileged upbringing.

94
06:18.160 --> 06:20.750
Only that lowly servant Xu Lanxiang

95
06:21.310 --> 06:23.070
knows what I want

96
06:23.070 --> 06:24.360
and what I despise.

97
06:25.190 --> 06:26.600
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang for you

98
06:26.720 --> 06:29.830
and wash away today's humiliation with her blood.

99
06:33.480 --> 06:35.190
This time, I'll do it myself.

100
06:38.630 --> 06:41.190
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang with my own hands.

101
07:01.950 --> 07:03.240
Attendant Eunuch Mao, please sit.

102
07:03.750 --> 07:04.600
I wouldn't dare.

103
07:04.840 --> 07:06.904
Now that the new Emperor has ascended the throne,

104
07:06.920 --> 07:08.670
there is a new Chief Eunuch of the Directorate of Ceremonial.

105
07:08.680 --> 07:10.310
A new sovereign brings new officials.

106
07:11.096 --> 07:12.510
I'm no longer an Attendant Eunuch,

107
07:12.568 --> 07:14.070
just a lowly eunuch with no standing.

108
07:14.680 --> 07:16.390
Madam, just call me Mao.

109
07:40.200 --> 07:43.310
Lin Jinqi suddenly fell seriously ill and asked Duke Xiangguo for sick leave

110
07:43.390 --> 07:44.728
to recuperate at his residence.

111
07:45.480 --> 07:47.510
I hear he's quite seriously ill.

112
07:47.640 --> 07:50.290
The Fourth Young Lady of the Lin family has already returned home.

113
07:50.376 --> 07:52.750
Even the Third Young Lady, who was only recently widowed,

114
07:52.830 --> 07:54.800
has had to set aside Marquis Yongchang's funeral arrangements

115
07:54.830 --> 07:56.376
and is trying to return to her family.

116
07:56.488 --> 07:59.048
She and the Yuan family are now locked in a bitter dispute.

117
08:03.160 --> 08:04.120
At present,

118
08:05.120 --> 08:06.480
troops from all quarters

119
08:06.950 --> 08:08.950
are rushing to the capital as reinforcements.

120
08:10.000 --> 08:12.000
There is no one left in Jinling to spare.

121
08:16.480 --> 08:21.310
Why would Duke Xiangguo agree to let Lin Jinqi take leave?

122
08:22.310 --> 08:23.510
When illness strikes,

123
08:23.800 --> 08:25.560
even Duke Xiangguo cannot defy fate.

124
08:27.560 --> 08:28.680
With no other choice,

125
08:28.800 --> 08:30.510
his son, Assistant Commander Xu,

126
08:30.520 --> 08:32.728
will have to escort the provisions in Lin Jinqi's place.

127
08:38.550 --> 08:40.720
I'm sure you still have instructions for Mister Zhang.

128
08:41.360 --> 08:42.440
I'll wait outside.

129
08:54.424 --> 08:56.520
I'll go with you to take revenge on the Lin family.

130
08:56.750 --> 08:58.790
Let the third chief handle the provisions.

131
09:04.440 --> 09:05.870
I went to great lengths

132
09:06.630 --> 09:08.670
to use revenge as a diversion,

133
09:09.320 --> 09:11.320
drawing Lin Jinqi away from the real target

134
09:12.320 --> 09:14.320
and keeping him in the city.

135
09:15.750 --> 09:17.670
You said Lin Jinqi was difficult to deal with.

136
09:19.000 --> 09:22.630
Tonight, I'm only putting on a show.

137
09:23.150 --> 09:24.600
My goal isn't revenge,

138
09:25.440 --> 09:28.960
but to burn the provisions.

139
09:30.510 --> 09:31.480
Without those provisions,

140
09:32.600 --> 09:34.240
the capital is certain to fall.

141
09:35.440 --> 09:37.480
Once the Wona army destroys the imperial court,

142
09:38.720 --> 09:40.270
I will no longer be a pirate,

143
09:42.080 --> 09:44.240
but the King of Jinling.

144
10:01.510 --> 10:02.320
Just wait.

145
10:03.360 --> 10:05.030
Tonight, I'll set a fire for you

146
10:06.550 --> 10:09.200
that lights up the entire city of Jinling.

147
10:39.540 --> 10:43.340
(Glorify the Family Name)

148
11:08.140 --> 11:11.180
(Yuan Jiaming, age eleven)

149
11:12.020 --> 11:14.700
(Yuan Jiaqin, age thirteen. Yuan Jiawei, age fourteen)

150
11:24.750 --> 11:25.670
All these years,

151
11:26.440 --> 11:28.030
things between Xiuru and Marquis Yuan

152
11:28.200 --> 11:29.790
weren't as they once were,

153
11:30.480 --> 11:32.320
but now that he's suddenly gone,

154
11:32.840 --> 11:34.270
I'm afraid Xiuru

155
11:35.208 --> 11:36.960
won't be able to accept it for some time.

156
11:40.030 --> 11:41.750
If this were the old Xiuru,

157
11:42.510 --> 11:43.960
she'd already be in tears.

158
11:45.390 --> 11:47.030
But with the way she is now,

159
11:48.248 --> 11:49.750
I can't quite tell how she'll react.

160
11:50.240 --> 11:51.870
I don't even know how to comfort her.

161
11:55.000 --> 11:56.270
What matters most right now

162
11:57.320 --> 11:59.600
is dealing with that murderous ghost, Du Cuique.

163
12:00.840 --> 12:01.870
Xiuwan is right.

164
12:28.000 --> 12:30.080
I'll sleep beside you tonight.

165
12:33.352 --> 12:35.448
Since we're all sleeping on the floor anyway,

166
12:36.440 --> 12:37.440
I'll sleep on the outside

167
12:37.840 --> 12:38.600
and protect you.

168
12:39.790 --> 12:40.750
I'm the eldest sister.

169
12:40.904 --> 12:42.970
If anyone should face danger first, it should be me.

170
12:43.150 --> 12:44.104
It's not your turn yet.

171
12:49.960 --> 12:51.390
What are you two arguing over?

172
12:52.360 --> 12:53.000
Suhua.

173
12:53.120 --> 12:54.080
- Suhua. - Suhua.

174
12:54.600 --> 12:55.240
Xiulai.

175
12:55.840 --> 12:56.550
Where's Lanxiang?

176
12:59.840 --> 13:01.030
After Lanxiang picked me up,

177
13:01.270 --> 13:04.030
she went straight to take care of Uncle Xu and Aunt Guihua.

178
13:19.240 --> 13:20.790
Look how fast I can fly.

179
13:21.320 --> 13:22.000
Zhangcheng,

180
13:22.080 --> 13:23.000
no more running around.

181
13:23.910 --> 13:25.870
Let me test you on a few characters.

182
13:30.488 --> 13:31.390
Come on, Mother.

183
13:31.390 --> 13:32.630
"Child."

184
13:32.720 --> 13:33.320
"Grandchild."

185
13:33.550 --> 13:35.120
You know "grandchild", too?

186
13:35.510 --> 13:39.000
You're Grandpa's granddaughter.

187
13:41.960 --> 13:45.720
"From child to grandchild, down to great-great-grandchild."

188
13:45.784 --> 13:46.664
"Great-grandchild."

189
13:46.840 --> 13:48.270
You know "great-grandchild", too?

190
13:51.550 --> 13:52.240
Xu.

191
13:54.670 --> 13:55.720
See for yourself.

192
13:56.080 --> 13:56.910
I've finished it.

193
13:57.910 --> 13:58.360
Good.

194
14:03.150 --> 14:05.000
Go on. Get back to what you need to do.

195
14:05.870 --> 14:07.030
Your father

196
14:07.790 --> 14:09.240
and Zhangcheng are here with me.

197
14:09.670 --> 14:10.670
That's enough.

198
14:18.320 --> 14:19.240
Go on.

199
14:21.672 --> 14:23.080
I've been an unfilial daughter.

200
14:23.800 --> 14:25.270
Mother, even while you're ill,

201
14:25.464 --> 14:27.480
I can't stay home and care for you in peace.

202
14:30.120 --> 14:32.000
My precious darling now

203
14:32.670 --> 14:33.840
is Zhangcheng.

204
14:34.320 --> 14:35.150
Just seeing her

205
14:35.840 --> 14:37.030
makes me happy.

206
14:41.320 --> 14:43.870
As for you, you'll have to take second place.

207
14:47.150 --> 14:49.510
Seeing Grandma makes me happiest, too.

208
14:50.550 --> 14:51.480
Is that so?

209
14:58.080 --> 14:58.600
Lanxiang,

210
15:00.080 --> 15:00.840
go on.

211
15:02.790 --> 15:03.440
Go.

212
15:08.360 --> 15:09.080
Go.

213
15:13.120 --> 15:13.600
Go on.

214
15:15.960 --> 15:16.720
Grandma,

215
15:16.960 --> 15:19.200
Grandpa made these two little birds for me.

216
15:20.000 --> 15:20.840
I'll give you one.

217
15:37.600 --> 15:38.630
It's flying!

218
15:38.670 --> 15:40.510
It's flying so high!

219
15:41.080 --> 15:41.870
Grandma,

220
15:41.910 --> 15:43.240
you have to get well soon.

221
15:43.480 --> 15:45.670
Then I can tell you stories from the plays.

222
15:53.270 --> 15:55.080
The courtyard gate will be locked soon.

223
15:55.840 --> 15:57.360
Father, make sure you bolt the door.

224
15:58.840 --> 16:00.440
No matter what you hear,

225
16:01.000 --> 16:01.960
don't come out.

226
16:02.670 --> 16:03.600
Don't worry.

227
16:04.030 --> 16:06.510
Back when that Emperor's army reached Jinling,

228
16:06.750 --> 16:09.000
your father was better at hiding than anyone.

229
16:09.390 --> 16:11.670
No lamps in the house.

230
16:12.030 --> 16:14.720
No moving around and no making a sound.

231
16:15.270 --> 16:17.240
Make it seem as though no one's home.

232
16:36.630 --> 16:40.960
No lamps, no moving around, and no making a sound.

233
16:42.840 --> 16:44.320
Even prisoners in the imperial prison

234
16:44.320 --> 16:46.000
don't have to suffer like this.

235
16:54.440 --> 16:57.720
You're too troubled to sleep too, Mother?

236
16:58.960 --> 17:00.270
There is a curfew at night.

237
17:00.670 --> 17:02.750
Soldiers guard the entrances to every ward.

238
17:03.200 --> 17:04.790
No one dares wander around.

239
17:05.720 --> 17:08.680
Lanxiang is just worrying over nothing

240
17:09.000 --> 17:10.510
and frightening everyone.

241
17:13.310 --> 17:14.680
Mother,

242
17:15.510 --> 17:17.400
with so many people crammed into one room,

243
17:17.480 --> 17:18.920
none of us can get any proper rest.

244
17:19.270 --> 17:22.400
Why don't we each go back to our own rooms and get some sleep?

245
17:22.920 --> 17:25.240
That way, we'll have the energy tomorrow

246
17:25.350 --> 17:26.424
to deal with Du Cuique.

247
17:27.110 --> 17:30.110
Mother.

248
17:31.510 --> 17:33.110
Stop going on about it to me.

249
17:33.240 --> 17:35.030
Lanxiang is in charge of the household now.

250
17:35.064 --> 17:37.070
If you want to go back to your own courtyard,

251
17:37.400 --> 17:38.790
go ask Lanxiang.

252
17:46.200 --> 17:47.350
All this fuss over nothing.

253
17:47.350 --> 17:48.840
You're only scaring yourselves.

254
17:50.640 --> 17:52.070
Du Cuique is just one woman.

255
17:52.480 --> 17:54.030
How dangerous could she possibly be?

256
17:59.830 --> 18:02.480
Fire!

257
18:02.480 --> 18:03.720
Come put out the fire!

258
18:04.568 --> 18:06.970
- Jinling City has twenty-five wards. - Fire! There's a fire!

259
18:06.980 --> 18:08.200
Come put out the fire!

260
18:08.200 --> 18:09.200
Three months ago,

261
18:09.256 --> 18:11.800
- I sent men to infiltrate the wards. - Put out the fire!

262
18:11.944 --> 18:13.740
They familiarized themselves with the terrain

263
18:13.750 --> 18:15.640
and searched for suitable places to start fires,

264
18:16.070 --> 18:17.750
while secretly spreading rumors

265
18:17.864 --> 18:19.750
that the Wona people were bloodthirsty killers.

266
18:19.750 --> 18:20.750
The Wona are here!

267
18:20.880 --> 18:22.830
The Wona have breached the capital!

268
18:23.160 --> 18:25.030
They've reached Jinling!

269
18:25.110 --> 18:26.720
They've reached Jinling!

270
18:26.920 --> 18:28.350
Once the time was right,

271
18:28.830 --> 18:29.960
it would take only a few men

272
18:30.830 --> 18:32.240
to throw the entire city

273
18:32.350 --> 18:33.720
into panic.

274
19:50.740 --> 19:53.020
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

275
19:53.030 --> 19:55.440
All the provisions loaded aboard have been inspected.

276
19:55.830 --> 19:57.680
We're about to set sail.

277
19:58.270 --> 19:59.830
The fate of the realm is at stake.

278
20:00.110 --> 20:02.680
Stay vigilant throughout the journey.

279
20:03.200 --> 20:03.960
- Yes. - Yes.

280
20:19.590 --> 20:22.400
The auspicious hour has arrived. Prepare to set sail.

281
20:22.590 --> 20:23.480
- Yes. - Yes.

282
21:13.300 --> 21:16.220
(Glorify the Family Name)

283
22:19.500 --> 22:23.460
(Glorify the Family Name)

284
22:36.590 --> 22:37.640
Xu Lanxiang,

285
22:39.880 --> 22:40.960
you're now

286
22:42.480 --> 22:44.750
the Marchioness of Marquis Jing'an's Residence.

287
22:45.240 --> 22:48.920
Even with Jinling's defenses stretched thin,

288
22:49.550 --> 22:51.550
you should have sent a few more soldiers

289
22:52.168 --> 22:53.790
to at least put on a show of strength.

290
22:54.680 --> 22:56.440
Just these few women?

291
22:58.030 --> 22:58.750
Do you really

292
22:59.830 --> 23:02.550
expect them to cry, make a scene, and threaten to hang themselves

293
23:03.590 --> 23:04.920
to scare me away?

294
23:06.550 --> 23:07.720
Recently, the Imperial Theater

295
23:07.960 --> 23:09.880
has been staging a new play

296
23:10.072 --> 23:11.880
called The Tale of the Burning Lamps.

297
23:12.400 --> 23:13.920
You really should go see it.

298
23:15.640 --> 23:16.830
Where is Lin Jinqi?

299
23:18.240 --> 23:20.400
As Commander of the Longjiang Garrison,

300
23:20.720 --> 23:24.030
His Lordship was ordered by Minister Han to escort provisions to the capital.

301
23:24.328 --> 23:26.440
Naturally, he's carrying out his official duties,

302
23:26.640 --> 23:28.000
guarding the provisions

303
23:28.880 --> 23:32.200
against traitors conspiring with Wona to cause trouble

304
23:32.880 --> 23:34.790
and attempting to burn the provisions.

305
23:40.590 --> 23:41.400
You...

306
23:43.440 --> 23:45.750
When did you find out I planned to burn the provisions?

307
23:52.960 --> 23:54.510
The day we received the flower ornament.

308
23:56.480 --> 23:58.550
Someone like you who operates in the shadows

309
23:59.070 --> 24:00.440
would seek revenge

310
24:00.750 --> 24:03.070
by plotting from some dark corner.

311
24:03.440 --> 24:05.350
Yet you not only openly

312
24:05.350 --> 24:07.000
killed Marquis Yongchang,

313
24:07.680 --> 24:09.400
but deliberately let Ding Peng escape

314
24:09.590 --> 24:11.432
so he could bring back the flower ornament.

315
24:12.200 --> 24:13.750
That's not like you.

316
24:15.030 --> 24:16.000
His Lordship and I

317
24:16.550 --> 24:18.070
naturally had to calm down

318
24:18.920 --> 24:20.070
and think it through.

319
24:22.030 --> 24:23.680
The autumn weather is dry.

320
24:25.240 --> 24:27.160
The provisions can easily catch fire.

321
24:28.270 --> 24:30.070
A few sparks would be enough.

322
24:31.030 --> 24:34.400
Whether Lin Jinqi can protect the provisions

323
24:34.640 --> 24:36.110
remains to be seen.

324
24:39.960 --> 24:40.960
Xu Lanxiang,

325
24:42.590 --> 24:43.640
tonight,

326
24:45.160 --> 24:46.920
you will die.

327
24:47.860 --> 24:51.340
(Glorify the Family Name)

328
27:42.790 --> 27:44.030
The scriptures say,

329
27:44.640 --> 27:46.960
"From one lamp, many lamps are lit,

330
27:48.640 --> 27:50.310
until ten thousand lamps shine bright."

331
28:14.320 --> 28:14.710
Oil?

332
28:16.030 --> 28:17.310
- Oil? - Oil?

333
28:49.510 --> 28:51.110
I advise you all to stay back.

334
28:52.110 --> 28:53.790
Du Cuique has a firearm.

335
28:54.030 --> 28:55.680
She must be carrying incendiary charges.

336
28:56.110 --> 28:57.480
Once they catch fire,

337
28:58.400 --> 28:59.880
they'll explode.

338
29:00.830 --> 29:01.680
Kill her!

339
29:03.070 --> 29:04.640
Kill that wretched servant!

340
29:13.510 --> 29:14.920
Zhang Shuizai is dead!

341
29:14.930 --> 29:17.100
The pirates sent to burn the provisions are all dead!

342
29:17.110 --> 29:18.830
His Lordship has won a decisive victory!

343
29:18.952 --> 29:20.480
- It's a trap! - We've been tricked!

344
29:20.480 --> 29:21.670
- Zhang Shuizai is dead! - Run! Go!

345
29:21.680 --> 29:23.640
- The pirates sent to burn the provisions are dead! - Run!

346
29:23.752 --> 29:25.432
His Lordship has won a decisive victory!

347
29:25.450 --> 29:26.070
Run! Hurry!

348
29:35.440 --> 29:36.270
Kill her!

349
29:37.110 --> 29:38.070
Kill them!

350
29:38.480 --> 29:39.640
Kill her!

351
29:55.540 --> 29:57.940
(Glorify the Family Name)

352
30:00.480 --> 30:01.510
Xu Lanxiang,

353
30:05.000 --> 30:06.110
you want me dead?

354
30:07.310 --> 30:08.110
Fine.

355
30:09.270 --> 30:10.110
Fine.

356
30:11.640 --> 30:13.640
Then come to hell with me!

357
30:42.350 --> 30:43.550
Xu Lanxiang!

358
30:43.680 --> 30:44.640
Die!

359
30:55.880 --> 30:58.640
Die! Die!

360
31:15.750 --> 31:17.510
Xu Lanxiang!

361
31:54.060 --> 31:57.960
♪Like passing clouds, fierce and unforgettable♪

362
31:58.650 --> 32:02.400
♪How can I fill the emptiness deep within?♪

363
32:03.210 --> 32:06.320
♪It fell into my heart♪

364
32:06.740 --> 32:10.380
♪And has never faded away♪

365
32:11.680 --> 32:15.120
♪If there were a promise♪

366
32:16.440 --> 32:16.960
Lanxiang!

367
32:18.960 --> 32:19.480
Lanxiang!

368
32:20.960 --> 32:21.480
Lanxiang!

369
32:24.680 --> 32:26.400
Lanxiang, are you all right?

370
32:26.830 --> 32:27.680
I'm fine.

371
32:28.140 --> 32:30.340
♪Those things I can't forget♪

372
32:30.560 --> 32:34.550
♪The absurdities I can't let go of fill every page♪

373
32:35.830 --> 32:36.270
Madam!

374
32:39.310 --> 32:41.550
I'm fine. What about you?

375
32:42.750 --> 32:43.510
We're fine.

376
32:44.840 --> 32:47.430
♪Memories hide away again♪

377
32:47.560 --> 32:48.910
♪Silent, yet♪

378
32:48.920 --> 32:51.660
♪They never stop shining♪

379
32:51.790 --> 32:53.680
♪Still burning bright♪

380
32:53.900 --> 32:56.640
♪That's what made me who I am♪

381
32:56.640 --> 33:00.960
♪The best days of my life♪

382
33:01.570 --> 33:05.080
♪Etched into my heart♪

383
33:05.110 --> 33:05.590
I'm fine.

384
33:05.590 --> 33:06.590
These past few years,

385
33:07.880 --> 33:10.440
whenever I couldn't sleep alone,

386
33:10.920 --> 33:12.590
I'd play the pipa to pass the time.

387
33:14.680 --> 33:15.830
I never imagined that today,

388
33:17.160 --> 33:18.680
I'd use it to take revenge.

389
33:26.680 --> 33:28.070
She truly got what she deserved.

390
33:30.504 --> 33:33.320
There's a reward for helping the authorities capture the pirates.

391
33:33.680 --> 33:34.720
Will we get one, too?

392
33:43.440 --> 33:44.480
Madam said

393
33:44.536 --> 33:46.030
the reward is fifty taels of silver.

394
33:46.550 --> 33:47.680
Everyone will get a share.

395
33:50.830 --> 33:51.750
That's wonderful!

396
33:54.310 --> 33:55.000
That's wonderful!

397
34:05.070 --> 34:06.680
His Lordship has won a decisive victory.

398
34:07.350 --> 34:08.630
Was anyone hurt?

399
34:13.360 --> 34:14.510
The city gates are closed.

400
34:15.550 --> 34:17.670
How could we know what's happening outside the city?

401
34:19.384 --> 34:21.540
I was just giving them a taste of their own medicine.

402
34:22.296 --> 34:24.230
I deliberately had people shout those words

403
34:24.710 --> 34:26.000
as a bluff

404
34:27.230 --> 34:29.110
to throw the pirates into disarray.

405
34:37.800 --> 34:39.230
His Lordship promised Zhangcheng

406
34:41.670 --> 34:43.590
that he would bring Nanke and Jiugao

407
34:44.760 --> 34:45.840
back safely.

408
37:50.590 --> 37:51.880
Three against one.

409
37:52.440 --> 37:53.960
You treacherous cowards.

410
38:04.800 --> 38:06.110
Lin Jinqi,

411
38:07.280 --> 38:09.480
if you dare, kill me with one strike.

412
38:15.840 --> 38:17.070
Don't kill him.

413
38:18.480 --> 38:20.270
Have him sent to the Ministry of Justice.

414
38:22.190 --> 38:26.920
Robbing imperial tribute, murdering court officials,

415
38:27.800 --> 38:30.070
colluding with Wona to burn the provisions,

416
38:31.480 --> 38:33.070
and committing treason.

417
38:33.480 --> 38:34.960
Whether principal or accomplice,

418
38:35.320 --> 38:36.110
under the law,

419
38:36.800 --> 38:38.440
all shall be executed by a thousand cuts.

420
38:47.400 --> 38:48.710
Make sure the executioner knows

421
38:49.320 --> 38:50.840
there must be a thousand cuts,

422
38:52.110 --> 38:53.480
not one fewer.

423
38:55.110 --> 38:55.590
Yes.

424
38:56.376 --> 38:57.670
Rest assured, Your Lordship.

425
39:00.110 --> 39:02.590
To honor the spirits of Marquis Yuan,

426
39:03.150 --> 39:04.440
Commander Ding,

427
39:04.550 --> 39:06.510
and all our fallen brothers,

428
39:06.960 --> 39:10.030
there will be more, not fewer.

429
39:36.500 --> 39:38.856
The pirates scattered sulfur powder over the provisions.

430
39:38.920 --> 39:40.700
I wasn't comfortable leaving it unattended,

431
39:40.710 --> 39:42.470
so I stayed to make sure the soldiers cleaned it all up.

432
39:42.480 --> 39:43.670
That delayed me somewhat.

433
39:43.752 --> 39:45.640
Sorry to have kept you waiting, Assistant Commander Xu.

434
39:45.920 --> 39:47.480
You killed over a hundred pirates

435
39:48.150 --> 39:49.590
and captured more than twenty alive.

436
39:49.880 --> 39:50.880
As the bait,

437
39:51.320 --> 39:52.440
I have fulfilled my mission.

438
39:52.616 --> 39:55.480
Many thanks to Duke Xiangguo and Assistant Commander Xu for your help.

439
39:56.400 --> 39:57.000
Take him away.

440
39:57.150 --> 39:57.670
Move!

441
40:04.110 --> 40:04.590
Go!

442
40:08.440 --> 40:10.400
The Xu family descends from a founding general.

443
40:10.584 --> 40:12.872
My father's generation is only the third since then.

444
40:13.510 --> 40:15.550
Our ancestor's valor has not yet been forgotten.

445
40:17.030 --> 40:17.840
It's just that...

446
40:22.150 --> 40:24.840
I'll leave things here to you, Marquis Lin.

447
40:25.360 --> 40:27.800
I must hurry back to oversee His Grace's funeral.

448
40:28.280 --> 40:29.150
Funeral?

449
40:31.030 --> 40:32.030
Duke Xiangguo...

450
40:33.710 --> 40:36.630
That night, you had Nanke deliver a secret letter

451
40:36.904 --> 40:39.670
asking Father to support your plan to turn their scheme against them

452
40:39.670 --> 40:40.990
and lure the pirates into a trap.

453
40:41.000 --> 40:43.750
Father was already struggling to hold on as he made the arrangements.

454
40:43.760 --> 40:45.110
Not long after Nanke left,

455
40:45.480 --> 40:46.880
Father passed away.

456
40:47.672 --> 40:49.070
Before he died, he instructed us

457
40:50.670 --> 40:52.000
to keep his death secret

458
40:52.232 --> 40:53.550
in order to maintain morale.

459
40:53.880 --> 40:55.480
If we failed to protect the provisions,

460
40:56.088 --> 40:58.056
the realm and our family would both be lost.

461
40:58.510 --> 41:00.480
Then he would rather be left without a burial.

462
41:00.776 --> 41:02.568
If we succeeded in protecting the provisions,

463
41:03.840 --> 41:05.400
I was to return and lay him to rest.

464
41:24.200 --> 41:26.280
When you pay your respects before his spirit tablet,

465
41:26.456 --> 41:28.440
please offer three sticks of incense on my behalf

466
41:29.150 --> 41:30.590
and tell Duke Xiangguo

467
41:31.670 --> 41:33.070
that I will deliver the provisions

468
41:33.630 --> 41:35.670
safely and intact to the capital

469
41:35.752 --> 41:37.544
and hand them over to Minister Han.

470
41:41.070 --> 41:41.550
All right.

471
42:01.460 --> 42:03.580
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

472
42:04.170 --> 42:06.230
♪Drifting through the rain♪

473
42:07.710 --> 42:08.150
Go.

474
42:08.950 --> 42:11.530
♪Held tightly in my hand, shielding me from hidden currents♪

475
42:12.020 --> 42:16.690
♪How could a thousand words soothe this aching heart?♪

476
42:16.790 --> 42:22.240
♪With guilt in my heart, how could I ask to meet again?♪

477
42:23.960 --> 42:29.020
♪May I be like a firefly awakening in the dark♪

478
42:29.260 --> 42:34.580
♪Even if I only illuminate a single corner♪

479
42:35.060 --> 42:39.950
♪If I could bring light to someone's eyes♪

480
42:40.200 --> 42:50.780
♪I'd spend this life and call it courage♪

481
42:50.880 --> 42:52.500
Set sail!

482
42:52.500 --> 42:53.900
- Set sail! - Set sail!

483
42:53.900 --> 42:54.860
Press on day and night!

484
42:54.860 --> 42:55.850
- Press on day and night! - Press on day and night!

485
42:55.850 --> 42:57.130
Make haste for the capital!

486
42:57.130 --> 42:59.100
- Make haste for the capital! - Make haste for the capital!

487
42:59.110 --> 42:59.960
- Yes! - Yes!

488
43:05.020 --> 43:07.940
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

489
43:09.480 --> 43:11.190
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

490
43:11.440 --> 43:11.880
What?

491
43:12.030 --> 43:12.710
Really?

492
43:13.280 --> 43:15.030
The Wona army has retreated!

493
43:15.070 --> 43:17.000
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

494
43:17.550 --> 43:20.110
The Wona army has retreated!

495
44:04.820 --> 44:08.940
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

496
44:11.780 --> 44:16.300
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

497
44:17.580 --> 44:21.500
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

498
44:22.180 --> 44:24.940
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

499
44:25.660 --> 44:27.980
♪Though all the world may fade♪

500
44:27.980 --> 44:31.060
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

501
44:32.580 --> 44:36.820
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

502
44:39.740 --> 44:43.900
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

503
44:45.700 --> 44:49.260
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

504
44:49.260 --> 44:52.820
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

505
44:53.620 --> 44:59.300
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

506
44:59.660 --> 45:03.980
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

507
45:04.340 --> 45:07.300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

508
45:07.300 --> 45:11.060
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

509
45:11.060 --> 45:13.940
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

510
45:13.940 --> 45:18.020
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

511
45:18.020 --> 45:21.380
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

512
45:21.380 --> 45:25.140
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

513
45:25.140 --> 45:29.140
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

514
45:29.900 --> 45:34.060
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

515
45:34.060 --> 45:37.500
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

516
45:37.500 --> 45:41.140
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

517
45:41.140 --> 45:44.020
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

518
45:44.020 --> 45:48.100
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

519
45:48.100 --> 45:51.460
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

520
45:51.460 --> 45:55.100
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

521
45:55.100 --> 46:02.900
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪
